    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d609">

                <pb facs="0586" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.515/97: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-04-17T17:00:00+03:25">April 17, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:32 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>394. Millspaugh has been informed concerning desired method of filing application
                    for gold bars and requested to specify type desired.</p>
                <p>British Legation reports that so far as it knows its proposal is awaiting
                    approval by Washington. There is no change in the matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
